Wiring the draft-create step into the collection and my POST /v3/plans keeps 201ing back a legacy-looking draft with no controller_count, which breaks my downstream mapping. Token in env is good. Here's the request:

<request>
POST {{base_url}}/v1/plans
headers: Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}
body: {"fields":["fld-north","fld-south"]}
</request>
Error: 201 {"planId":"plan-legacy-0001","status":"draft"}

That's the deprecated route and the shape's wrong — fix it to hit the canonical v3 draft create so the response actually carries controller_count, and give me what the corrected call returns.

